{"_note":"年度贡献:GraphQL contributionCalendar(整年逐日,与 github.com 个人页同源同口径)。**由 tools/infosource/gen_github_todo.py 生成,不要手改**。\nv41 起查 `viewer`(令牌的主人)而不是用户填的用户名 —— 令牌已经是必需的,再让人填一遍用户名是多余的一步,还可能填成别人。","version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"t0","value":"${@time.nowMs}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"MONE","value":["Jan","Feb","Mar","Apr","May","Jun","Jul","Aug","Sep","Oct","Nov","Dec"]}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_zh","value":"$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_yue","value":"月"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hdr","value":{"Accept":"application/json","Content-Type":"application/json","User-Agent":"Numable"}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"body","value":"{\"query\": \"query{viewer{login contributionsCollection{contributionCalendar{totalContributions weeks{firstDay contributionDays{contributionCount}}}}}}\"}"}},{"_note":"GraphQL 出错恒返 200、错误在 errors[] 里;没绑 / 令牌失效时是 401。两种情况下 data.viewer 都取不到 → 下面 ok=0,不会假绿。","id":"q","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${body}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"handle","value":"${q.data.viewer.login}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"wks","value":"${q.data.viewer.contributionsCollection.contributionCalendar.weeks}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nW","value":"$[length::(${wks})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ok","value":"$[if::(ge::(${nW},1),1,0)]"},"_note":"⚠️ 判据是**日历有没有回来**(周数),不是 totalContributions —— 零贡献的新账号 total=0 是合法数据。"},{"_note":"取数失败出口(同 todo.df):日历没回来 = 这一轮不可信,抛错让宿主保留上一张好图。","op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),0,1)]"},"items":[{"action":"error","params":{"errorMsg":"github graphql: contribution calendar missing"}}]},{"_note":"⚠️ ok=0 时 total/heat **整个键不发**:发空 h